<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-CA TROPHY FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CA TROPHY FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the $800,000</p>
<p>CA Trophy men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 6-0</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Stefan Edberg (Sweden) beat Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Omar Camporese (Italy) beat Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
